    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.poster.avif?t=1722225204\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.webm?t=1722225204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.mp4?t=1722225204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Meet Mousse, The Heroic Cat</h2>Mousse would rather nap the day away, but when the mice decide to hunt the cat, he must defend his home. Using his four quick paws and quicker thinking, Mousse has the cunning and charm to beat back the waves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/78bd803ae8d987ed2bba1bdac7369f50.avif?t=1722225204\" width=762 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 Build Your Feline Fortress</h2>Whittle down the many ranks of the rodent army, not with your claws, but your feline engineering. Scamper around the yard to build layers of traps and weapons to mount a brilliant cat tower defense.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d Outsmart the Mice Army</h2>The Mice Army has more than just numbers to threaten the cozy cat\u2019s home.<br>From flight to bombs to magic, the invaders have the resources and tenacity to keep Mousse on his toes. Maybe he took their cheese?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Embrace the Fun</h2>Bursting with creativity and color, Feline Fortress\u2019 cat and mouse game is both challenging and fun. Come join Mousse on the lively last line of defense!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.poster.avif?t=1722225204\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.webm?t=1722225204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/1cf5f3e8cf6f71117b7e3b6dbce6c6ad.mp4?t=1722225204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e Meet Mousse, The Heroic Cat</h2>Mousse would rather nap the day away, but when the mice decide to hunt the cat, he must defend his home. Using his four quick paws and quicker thinking, Mousse has the cunning and charm to beat back the waves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2650790/extras/78bd803ae8d987ed2bba1bdac7369f50.avif?t=1722225204\" width=762 height=300 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0 Build Your Feline Fortress</h2>Whittle down the many ranks of the rodent army, not with your claws, but your feline engineering. Scamper around the yard to build layers of traps and weapons to mount a brilliant cat tower defense.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc2d Outsmart the Mice Army</h2>The Mice Army has more than just numbers to threaten the cozy cat\u2019s home.<br>From flight to bombs to magic, the invaders have the resources and tenacity to keep Mousse on his toes. Maybe he took their cheese?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f Embrace the Fun</h2>Bursting with creativity and color, Feline Fortress\u2019 cat and mouse game is both challenging and fun. Come join Mousse on the lively last line of defense!",
    "short_description": "Join Mousse the cat in this action-packed tower defense game! Pounce on the incoming mouse invasion alongside re-engineered cat post towers and yarn ball cat-a-pults. As enemy waves pour in from land and air, use Mousse\u2019s quick agility and feline intelligence to show them who truly rules, paws down!",
